2.  HOW MUCH OF r_1 IS EXTRAPOLATION?
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  7 of 7 crossings are EXTRAPOLATED beyond the last gas-measured radius; the data reach a median 0.53 x r_1 (a value >= 1 means the crossing is inside the data)
  [FAIL] 2a CAN FAIL: is the crossing inside the data for most clusters?  If every r_1 is an extrapolation the candidate is a statement about a fitted power law and not about a measurement   (7/7 extrapolated; data reach median 0.53 x r_1)

